{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30382","headline":"送韩绦归淮南寄韩绰先辈 · 赵嘏","name":"送韩绦归淮南寄韩绰先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岛上花枝系钓船，隋家宫畔水连天。\n江帆自落鸟飞外，月观静依春色边。\n门巷草生车辙在，朝廷恩及雁行联。\n相逢且问昭州事，曾鼓庄盆对逝川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}